  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The $156.3 million project aims to improve urban services and climate resilience by investing in priority water supply and stormwater drainage infrastructure and supporting urban reforms including improving ULBs&apos; own revenue base. The project will also support studies for future urban investments with due consideration to climate resilience.</narrative>
